---
// Three Pillars Cards matching raw/beranda.html
---
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8" id="keunggulan">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <!-- Card 1: Soft Ice Blue (Character & Adab) -->
    <div 
      class="bg-brand-iceBlue rounded-3xl p-8 border border-blue-100 flex flex-col justify-between transition transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-soft"
      data-aos="fade-up"
      data-aos-delay="100"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6">
          🌱
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 font-sans">Pendidikan Karakter & Adab</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
          Pembiasaan ibadah yaumiyyah, adab santri 24 jam di asrama ramah anak, serta keteladanan para asatidz bersanad untuk membentuk kepribadian jujur, mandiri, dan berbakti.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-blue-200/50 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800">
        <span>Bimbingan Asrama 24 Jam</span>
        <span>→</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: Soft Mint/Sage (Tahfidz & Turats) -->
    <div 
      class="bg-brand-mint rounded-3xl p-8 border border-emerald-100 flex flex-col justify-between transition transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-soft"
      data-aos="fade-up"
      data-aos-delay="200"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6">
          📖
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 font-sans">Tahfidz & Kajian Turats</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
          Program intensif Tahfidzul Qur’an dengan bimbingan hafizh-hafizhah muqrin bersanad, dilengkapi telaah kitab kuning klasik khas pesantren salaf warisan para ulama nusantara.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-emerald-200/50 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">
        <span>Sanad Muttashil Rasulullah ﷺ</span>
        <span>→</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: Soft Yellow/Cream (Science & Global Competence) -->
    <div 
      class="bg-brand-warmYellow rounded-3xl p-8 border border-amber-100 flex flex-col justify-between transition transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-soft"
      data-aos="fade-up"
      data-aos-delay="300"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-900 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6">
          🔬
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 font-sans">Sains & Wawasan Global</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans">
          Kurikulum nasional terpadu pengayaan STEM (Science, Technology, Engineering, Math), laboratorium riset, serta penguasaan aktif dwi-bahasa (Arab & Inggris).
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-amber-200/50 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-amber-900">
        <span>Kemitraan Olimpiade & Riset</span>
        <span>→</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
